# Changes to these paths need a review from the governance owner.
# Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection for main.
#
# CI checks each pull request with that pull request's own copy of the
# governance scripts (so rule changes are tested before they merge). That's
# only safe because changes to the scripts, rules, and gateway are owned here.

# Governance rules, exceptions, standards, and the pipeline itself
